선에 관한 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9C%84%ED%82%A4%EB%B0%B1%EA%B3%BC:%ED%86%A0%EB%A7%89%EA%B8%80\" title=\"위키백과:토막글\">토막글</a>입니다. 여러분의 지식으로 알차게 <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//ko.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%ED%83%9C%EC%96%91_%EA%B4%80%EC%B8%A1_%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%ED%83%9C%EC%96%91_%EA%B4%80%EC%B8%A1_%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1&amp;action=edit\">문서를 완성해</a> 갑시다.\n</td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐int.eqiad.main‐599ddbb69d‐b5wb9\nCached time: 20261007001555\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.150 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.317 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 776/1000000\nRevision size: 931/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 23627/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 570/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9144/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.055/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1351883/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  220.677      1 -total\n 58.74%  129.617      1 틀:위키데이터_속성_추적\n 27.84%   61.430      1 틀:태양_탐사선\n 26.89%   59.349      1 틀:둘러보기_상자\n  7.98%   17.618      1 틀:Llang\n  5.34%   11.775      1 틀:토막글\n  3.79%    8.363      1 틀:이름공간_검출\n  1.42%    3.135      1 틀:Lang\n  1.03%    2.269      1 틀:임시링크\n  0.93%    2.048      1 틀:토막글/그림\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 433d73f2-c1e4-11f1-9a12-99e7d5a11ce1 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key kowiki:pcache:1075867:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261007001555 and revision id 40357565. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
